        194.14523315429688,
        519.430908203125,
        206.6187286376953
      ],
      "text": "28. ART should be started as soon as possible within two weeks of initiating TB treatment, regardless of CD4 cell",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08460235595703,
        205.54519653320312,
        239.74400329589844,
        218.01869201660156
      ],
      "text": "count, among people living with HIV. ​  (25) a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08460235595703,
        219.77993774414062,
        414.4627685546875,
        232.25343322753906
      ],
      "text": "Adults and adolescents  (strong recommendation, low- to moderate-certainty evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        234.01449584960938,
        314.1576843261719,
        246.4879913330078
      ],
      "text": "Except when signs and symptoms of meningitis are present a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        248.86782836914062,
        502.2417297363281,
        261.3413391113281
      ],
      "text": "29. Antiretroviral therapy is recommended for all patients with HIV and drug-resistant tuberculosis requiring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        260.2677917480469,
        510.7412414550781,
        272.7413024902344
      ],
      "text": "second-line antituberculosis drugs, irrespective of CD4 cell count, as early as possible (within the first 8 weeks)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        271.6678161621094,
        508.4700012207031,
        284.1413269042969
      ],
      "text": "following initiation of antituberculosis treatment  .  (strong recommendation, very-low-certainty evidence) (16, 21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        286.5210876464844,
        496.9339904785156,
        298.9945983886719
      ],
      "text": "30. Routine co-trimoxazole prophylaxis should be given to all people living with HIV with active TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        297.9211120605469,
        401.7845153808594,
        310.3946228027344
      ],
      "text": "regardless of CD4 cell count  ​  (strong recommendation, high-certainty evidence). (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        314.0771484375,
        306.4383850097656,
        327.26715087890625
      ],
      "text": "Integrated delivery of care for HIV-associated TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        331.3932189941406,
        522.25537109375,
        343.8667297363281
      ],
      "text": "31. In settings with a high burden of HIV and TB, ART should be initiated in TB treatment settings, with linkage to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        342.793212890625,
        413.2884216308594,
        355.2667236328125
      ],
      "text": "ongoing HIV care and ART  .  (strong recommendation, very-low-certainty evidence) (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.0564270019531,
        194.8867950439453,
        396.6314392089844
      ],
      "text": "3.2.1\t Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.38671875,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "WHO defines advanced HIV disease for adults and adolescents (and children five years and older)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4215698242188,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "as having a CD4 cell count of less than 200 cells/mm  or WHO clinical stage 3 or 4 disease  .  (13) 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.3966674804688,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "All children younger than five years living with HIV are considered to have advanced HIV disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.3911743164062,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "People presenting with advanced HIV disease are at high risk of death, even after starting ART,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        524.3651733398438,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with the risk increasing with decreasing CD4 cell count, especially with CD4 cell count < 100 cells/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4215698242188,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "mm . Advanced HIV disease is also associated with increased healthcare costs  ,  (98-101) (102) 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.3980102539062,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "increased risk of opportunistic infections, immune reconstitution inflammatory syndrome (IRIS),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.39453125,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "incomplete immune reconstitution, higher viral reservoirs, higher inflammation, increased risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4528198242188,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of HIV-related and non-HIV-related comorbidities, use of more healthcare services and more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        227.29220581054688,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "frequent monitoring needs  .  (102)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4113159179688,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "To address the leading causes of morbidity and mortality among people with advanced HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        524.384033203125,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "disease, WHO recommends that a package of interventions including screening, treatment and/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4201049804688,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "or prophylaxis for major opportunistic infections, rapid ART initiation, and intensified adherence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4146118164062,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "support interventions, be offered to everyone (all populations and age groups) living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        250.2002410888672,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "presenting with advanced HIV disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
